open-android-use
================

A "Second Pair of Hands" for Android. This repository is open-core:

  * Engine — the host-side Go bridge (apps/OpenAndroidUse), the inherited
    desktop runtimes (macOS/Windows/Linux), and the npm packaging — is licensed
    under the MIT License. See LICENSE.

  * The Android app (apps/OpenAndroidUseCompanion) — the on-device companion
    and agent, the product destined for the Play Store — is licensed under the
    PolyForm Perimeter License 1.0.0 (source-available, no-compete),
    Copyright (c) 2026 Blokz Development Co.
    See apps/OpenAndroidUseCompanion/LICENSE.


